 humane care, without discrimination. In an emergency, the ER will not ask for a deposit before treating you (Republic Act No. 10932).",{"children":"To appropriate and humane care, without discrimination. In an emergency, the ER will not ask for a deposit before treating you (Republic Act No. 10932)."}],["$","li","To be told about your condition, the treatment we recommend, its risks and alternatives, and the expected costs — in Cebuano, Filipino or English.",{"children":"To be told about your condition, the treatment we recommend, its risks and alternatives, and the expected costs — in Cebuano, Filipino or English."}],["$","li","To give or refuse consent before any procedure, and to refuse treatment after its risks are explained.",{"children":"To give or refuse consent before any procedure, and to refuse treatment after its risks are explained."}],["$","li","To privacy and confidentiality. Your records and results are released only to you or someone you authorise in writing.",{"children":"To privacy and confidentiality. Your records and results are released only to you or someone you authorise in writing."}],["$","li","To choose your doctor, and to ask for a second opinion.",{"children":"To choose your doctor, and to ask for a second opinion."}],["$","li","To an itemised bill, with PhilHealth, HMO, senior and PWD benefits applied.",{"children":"To an itemised bill, with PhilHealth, HMO, senior and PWD benefits applied."}],["$","li","To leave the hospital. We will not detain you for an unpaid bill (Republic Act No. 9439); the billing section will arrange a promissory note.",{"children":"To leave the hospital. We will not detain you for an unpaid bill (Republic Act No. 9439); the billing section will arrange a promissory note."}],"$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12"]}],"$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17"],"$L18"]}],"$L19"]}]],null,"$L1a"]}],"p":"$@1b","v":"$1c","s":"$9"}}]]
